    reg {
        name = "AC Huffman symbol table memory (176 words)";
        desc = "176 words from structure +0x1F8, base index 0x100 words (byte offset 0x400).

Source: vendor module static analysis (open_jpegd.ko, jpegd_drv_write_regs, offset 0x400), confidence HIGH for offset and length, MEDIUM for the content. Not verified on hardware (nothing in this block has been read or written on a Hi3516A V300 board); no reset value is known; not in the data sheet (it has no JPGD register table).";

        field {
